# 高压段细网格: 定位 PHREEQC 溶解 CO2 的失稳区间
SOLUTION 1
    units       mol/L
    temp        25
    -water      1.0
    K           0.2
    Alkalinity  0.2  as HCO3
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure   19.03106
    CO2(g)      19.00000
    H2O(g)      0.03106
END

